  "text": "## PART 7: Practical Scenarios  \n### Scenario 1: New Customer — Saving Money  \n**Customer:** \"I've got £20,000 to put away. Where should it go?\"  \n**Your Response:**\n\"Great! You're in our higher tier. With £20,000, you'd earn our premium rate of 4.70% AER on SmartSaver.  \nThat's about £102/month in interest (£20,000 × 4.70% ÷ 365 × 30).  \nYou can withdraw anytime if you need the money. No fees, no minimums. Would you like to open one?\"",
